Single-warpgroup persistent W2 correctness gate
Date: 2026-09-03
Environment: V4_W2_PERSISTENT_BLOCKS_PER_SM=8, two weight stages

Design under test:
- one 128-thread WGMMA warpgroup per CTA;
- fixed grid with device-runtime num_tokens_padded task bound;
- strided task scheduler safe for CUDA Graph route metadata changes;
- LUT and mbarriers initialized once per CTA;
- barrier parity advances from the global task/K-tile sequence;
- double-buffered route metadata plus one CTA rendezvous per task.

